Third-party licenses for rtl-airband-panel
==========================================

The rtl-airband-panel binary in this release is licensed under the GNU
General Public License version 3 only (see LICENSE). This file lists every
Rust crate compiled into it, grouped by the license each is used under,
followed by that license's full text. The panel's own crates
(rtl-airband-panel, airband-*) appear under GPL-3.0-only; all others are
third-party.

This file covers the panel only. rtl_airband, also in this release, is a
separate program with its own license (LICENSE.rtl_airband) and source
(SOURCE.txt).

